WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.849
Step 1. Open the service request page,

1.2
00:00:02.849 --> 00:00:07.021
where you create the diagnostic report and enter its results.

1.3
00:00:07.021 --> 00:00:12.171
In the encounter, select the Service Requests tab, then See Details.

2.1
00:00:12.171 --> 00:00:15.027
Step 2. Create the diagnostic report.

2.2
00:00:15.027 --> 00:00:20.733
When only one report type remains, Care selects it for you. Select Create Report.

2.3
00:00:20.733 --> 00:00:23.557
The report starts as Preliminary.

3.1
00:00:23.557 --> 00:00:25.526
Step 3. Enter the results.

3.2
00:00:25.526 --> 00:00:31.011
This group has one labelled field for each component of the observation definition.

3.3
00:00:31.011 --> 00:00:36.336
Type a value in each. You cannot change the unit at the end of the field.

4.1
00:00:36.336 --> 00:00:40.588
Step 4. Add an observation definition or remove a result.

4.2
00:00:40.588 --> 00:00:45.432
Select Add observation for a definition the request does not require.

4.3
00:00:45.432 --> 00:00:50.636
To remove an unsaved result, select Remove observation in its menu.

5.1
00:00:50.636 --> 00:00:54.608
Step 5. Write the conclusion. The conclusion is optional.

5.2
00:00:54.608 --> 00:00:59.832
In the Conclusion box, summarise the findings and anything the requesting doctor

5.3
00:00:59.832 --> 00:01:01.246
should act on.

6.1
00:01:01.246 --> 00:01:04.793
Step 7. Save the results. Select Save Results.

6.2
00:01:04.793 --> 00:01:08.448
Care saves the results and the conclusion together,

6.3
00:01:08.448 --> 00:01:14.824
and the report stays Preliminary. Its review card opens under Review Test Results.
